sequenceDiagram
    participant Client as MCP Client
    participant Router as Router
    participant ChatTool as Chat Tool
    participant JobRunner as Job Runner
    participant AsyncJobStore as Job Store
    participant EventBus as Event Bus
    Note over EventBus: EventBus handles internal coordination only
    participant StreamNorm as Stream Normalizer
    participant Provider as LLM Provider
    participant FileCache as File Cache
    
    Note over Client,FileCache: Async Chat Tool Execution Sequence
    
    %% Initial Request
    Client->>Router: chat(messages, async=true)
    Router->>ChatTool: invoke(messages, {async: true})
    
    %% Job Creation
    ChatTool->>AsyncJobStore: create(jobSpec)
    AsyncJobStore-->>ChatTool: jobState (status: queued)
    ChatTool->>EventBus: emit('job.created', {jobId, sessionId})
    Note over EventBus: Internal event - not sent to client
    
    %% Immediate Response
    ChatTool-->>Router: {continuation_id: jobId, status: 'queued'}
    Router-->>Client: MCP Response with continuation_id
    
    %% Background Execution Starts
    ChatTool->>JobRunner: submit(jobSpec, chatRunFn)
    JobRunner->>AsyncJobStore: update(jobId, {status: 'running'})
    JobRunner->>EventBus: emit('job.updated', {status: 'running'})
    Note over EventBus: Internal event - not sent to client
    
    %% Provider Streaming
    JobRunner->>StreamNorm: normalize provider stream
    StreamNorm->>Provider: invoke with streaming
    
    loop Streaming Response
        Provider-->>StreamNorm: stream chunk
        StreamNorm-->>JobRunner: normalized event
        JobRunner->>AsyncJobStore: update partial state
        JobRunner->>FileCache: writeJournalEvent(event)
        JobRunner->>EventBus: emit('job.updated', progress)
        Note over EventBus: Internal progress - not sent to client
    end
    
    %% Completion
    Provider-->>StreamNorm: stream end
    StreamNorm-->>JobRunner: end event
    JobRunner->>AsyncJobStore: complete(jobId, finalResult)
    JobRunner->>FileCache: writeSnapshot(jobId, result)
    JobRunner->>EventBus: emit('job.completed', {jobId})
    Note over EventBus: Internal completion event
    
    Note over Client,FileCache: Status Check Sequence (Client Polling)
    
    %% Client must poll for status - no server-initiated updates
    Client->>Router: check_status(continuation_id)
    Router->>AsyncJobStore: get(continuation_id)
    alt Job in Memory
        AsyncJobStore-->>Router: full job state
    else Job not in Memory
        Router->>FileCache: readSnapshot(continuation_id)
        FileCache-->>Router: cached result
    end
    Router-->>Client: detailed status response
    
    Note over Client,FileCache: Consensus Tool Sequence (Multi-Provider)
    
    %% Consensus Request
    Client->>Router: consensus(prompt, models=['gpt-5','gemini-2.5-pro'], async=true)
    Router->>ConsensusTool: invoke with async=true
    ConsensusTool->>AsyncJobStore: create multi-provider job
    ConsensusTool-->>Client: continuation_id (immediate return)
    
    %% Parallel Provider Execution  
    par Provider 1 (OpenAI)
        ConsensusTool->>StreamNorm: normalize OpenAI stream
        StreamNorm->>Provider: OpenAI invoke
        loop OpenAI Streaming
            Provider-->>StreamNorm: OpenAI chunk
            StreamNorm-->>ConsensusTool: normalized event
            ConsensusTool->>AsyncJobStore: update provider 1 progress
            ConsensusTool->>EventBus: emit provider 1 progress
        end
    and Provider 2 (Google)
        ConsensusTool->>StreamNorm: normalize Google stream  
        StreamNorm->>Provider: Google invoke
        loop Google Streaming
            Provider-->>StreamNorm: Google chunk
            StreamNorm-->>ConsensusTool: normalized event
            ConsensusTool->>AsyncJobStore: update provider 2 progress
            ConsensusTool->>EventBus: emit provider 2 progress
        end
    end
    
    %% Cross-Feedback Phase
    ConsensusTool->>ConsensusTool: aggregate initial responses
    ConsensusTool->>AsyncJobStore: update(phase: 'cross_feedback')
    
    par Cross-Feedback Streaming
        ConsensusTool->>Provider: send cross-feedback to Provider 1
        ConsensusTool->>Provider: send cross-feedback to Provider 2
        loop Refinement Streaming
            Provider-->>ConsensusTool: refined responses
            ConsensusTool->>AsyncJobStore: update refinement progress
        end
    end
    
    %% Consensus Completion
    ConsensusTool->>ConsensusTool: build final consensus
    ConsensusTool->>AsyncJobStore: complete with consensus result
    ConsensusTool->>FileCache: writeSnapshot(consensus_result)
    ConsensusTool->>EventBus: emit('job.completed')
    Note over EventBus: Internal completion event